# ================================================================
# EXCLUSIONS (things we WANT to track)
# ================================================================

# Keep example files
!.env.example
!.gitignore
!README.md
!requirements.txt
!.venv/

# Keep important configuration
!config/
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.json

# Keep source code
!src/
!bsee/
!tests/
!*.py

# Keep documentation
!docs/
!*.md
!*.txt

# Keep deployment scripts
!deploy.sh
!*.sh
!*.bat

# ================================================================
# NOTES:
# 1. This gitignore is comprehensive for BSEE project
# 2. .venv/ is included to ensure packages are downloadable
# 3. All generated data directories are ignored
# 4. Development artifacts are ignored but source code is kept
# 5. Configuration files are tracked for reproducibility
# ================================================================